53}+x_{975}$.","role":"user"}],"rendered_sha256":"46157dd55ff5955642535ba35ea2e04bde1667fd990255f0e22502ac7e4efaa2"},"seconds":89.37751722335815,"seed":98353377449285462,"stop":"eos","text":"To solve the problem, we first need to understand the recurrence relation given for the sequence \\( x_n \\):\n\n\\[ x_n = x_{n-1} - x_{n-2} + x_{n-3} - x_{n-4} \\]\n\nfor \\( n \\geq 5 \\), with the initial conditions:\n\\[ x_1 = 211, \\quad x_2 = 375, \\quad x_3 = 420, \\quad x_4 = 523. \\]\n\nWe will compute the first few terms to identify any patterns.\n\nFirst, let's calculate \\( x_5 \\):\n\\[ x_5 = x_4 - x_3 + x_2 - x_1 = 523 - 420 + 375 - 211 = 267. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_6 \\):\n\\[ x_6 = x_5 - x_4 + x_3 - x_2 = 267 - 523 + 420 - 375 = -101. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_7 \\):\n\\[ x_7 = x_6 - x_5 + x_4 - x_3 = -101 - 267 + 523 - 420 = -265. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_8 \\):\n\\[ x_8 = x_7 - x_6 + x_5 - x_4 = -265 + 101 + 267 - 523 = -410. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_9 \\):\n\\[ x_9 = x_8 - x_7 + x_6 - x_5 = -410 + 265 - 101 + 267 = 221. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{10} \\):\n\\[ x_{10} = x_9 - x_8 + x_7 - x_6 = 221 + 410 - 265 + 101 = 467. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{11} \\):\n\\[ x_{11} = x_{10} - x_9 + x_8 - x_7 = 467 - 221 - 410 + 265 = 91. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{12} \\):\n\\[ x_{12} = x_{11} - x_{10} + x_9 - x_8 = 91 - 467 + 221 + 410 = 255. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{13} \\):\n\\[ x_{13} = x_{12} - x_{11} + x_{10} - x_9 = 255 - 91 + 467 - 221 = 410. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{14} \\):\n\\[ x_{14} = x_{13} - x_{12} + x_{11} - x_{10} = 410 - 255 + 91 - 467 = -221. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{15} \\):\n\\[ x_{15} = x_{14} - x_{13} + x_{12} - x_{11} = -221 - 410 + 255 - 91 = -467. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{16} \\):\n\\[ x_{16} = x_{15} - x_{14} + x_{13} - x_{12} = -467 + 221 + 410 - 255 =  -91. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{17} \\):\n\\[ x_{17} = x_{16} - x_{15} + x_{14} - x_{13} = -91 + 467 - 221 - 410 = -255. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{18} \\):\n\\[ x_{18} = x_{17} - x_{16} + x_{15} - x_{14} = -255 + 91 - 467 + 221 = -410. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{19} \\):\n\\[ x_{19} = x_{18} - x_{17} + x_{16} - x_{15} = -410 + 255 + 91 + 467 = 403. \\]\n\nNext, we calculate \\( x_{20} \\):\n\\[ x_{20} = x_{19} - x_{18} + x_{17} - x_{16} = 403 + 410 - 255 + 91 = 649. \\]\n\nWe observe that the sequence repeats every 12 terms. Therefore, we can find the values of \\( x_{531} \\), \\( x_{753} \\), and \\( x_{975} \\) by reducing the indices modulo 12.\n\n\\[ 531 \\mod 12 = 3 \\]\n\\[ 753 \\mod 12 = 9 \\]\n\\[ 975 \\mod 12 = 3 \\]\n\nSo, \\( x_{531} = x_3 = 420 \\), \\( x_{753} = x_9 = 221 \\), and \\( x_{975} = x_3 = 420 \\).\n\nThus, the value of \\( x_{531} + x_{753} + x_{975} \\) is:\n\\[ 420 + 221 + 420 = 1061. \\]\n\nThe final answer is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{1061}\n\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{1061}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
